    Burimi & df & SS & MS & $F$ & Vendimi \\ \midrule
    A & 1 & 30 & 30 & 10.0 & $>4.41$: po \\
    B & 2 & 104 & 52 & 17.3 & $>3.55$: po \\
    A$\times$B & 2 & 12 & 6 & 2.0 & $<3.55$: jo \\
    Brenda & 18 & 54 & 3 & & \\ \midrule
